{"id":"n66640-3-7","stage":3,"title":"뼈 · 梗概","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n66640-3-7-1","ko":"그러니까 말이야. 이야기를 하면 길거든.","zh":"就是说啊，要聊这件事的话可没完没了呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그러니까","meaning":"换言之；或换句话说。","explanation":"그러니까：换言之；或换句话说。","readings":[{"term":"그러니까","audio":"/audio/f064d1058a27cd3851f3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58609","senseId":"2","lemma":"그러니까","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그러니까","audio":"/audio/f064d1058a27cd3851f3.mp3"}},{"text":"말이야.","meaning":"表示引发注意或结束句子时使用的词汇。","explanation":"말：表示引发注意或结束句子时使用的词汇；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"말","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27260","senseId":"11","lemma":"말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"말이야","audio":"/audio/fd5a3f00cd7342725148.mp3"}},{"text":"이야기를","meaning":"聊天，说话","explanation":"이야기：聊天，说话；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"이야기","audio":"/audio/ffe0179e59e74069bc54.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60321","senseId":"2","lemma":"이야기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이야기를","audio":"/audio/bce72d3b4d1b11764a95.mp3"}},{"text":"하면","meaning":"表示说这样那样的话。","explanation":"하다：表示说这样那样的话；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"28","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하면","audio":"/audio/01692c67203f44175054.mp3"}},{"text":"길거든.","meaning":"长","explanation":"길다：长；거든：补充理由或背景，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"길다","audio":"/audio/013e520a738e476f5fd9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26808","senseId":"3","lemma":"길다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"길거든","audio":"/audio/b29f5bfa406717308d1c.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"f064d1058a27cd38","term":"그러니까","zh":"换言之；或换句话说。","audio":"/audio/f064d1058a27cd3851f3.mp3","entryId":"58609",